      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 例：常數屋頂",
      "body": [
        "逐點：$x=0$ 時 $0$；$x>0$ 時 $\\le\\frac{nx}{n^2x^2}=\\frac1{nx}\\to0$",
        "屋頂：$1+n^2x^2\\ge2nx$（算幾不等式）",
        "控制收斂：$\\displaystyle\\lim\\int_0^1\\frac{nx}{1+n^2x^2}dx=\\int_0^10\\,dx=0$",
