        "控制收斂定理：$\\lim\\int_0^1 f_n=\\int_0^1 0=0$。",
        "核對：$\\int_0^1\\frac{nx}{1+n^2x^2}\\,dx=\\ln\\frac{1+n^2}{2n}\\to0$。注意這不是一致收斂：$x=\\frac{1}{n}$ 時 $f_n=\\frac{1}{2}$，$\\sup$ 範數一直是 $\\frac{1}{2}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "0",
      "claim": "n*x/(1+n^2*x^2) <= 1/2 ;; INT(n*x/(1+n^2*x^2), 0, 1) == ln(1+n^2)/(2n) ;; LIM(ln(1+n^2)/(2n), inf) == 0 ;; SUB(n*x/(1+n^2*x^2), 1/n) == 1/2"
    },
