      "problemId": "lb-con-003",
      "steps": [
        "最小的屋頂是 $G(x)=\\sup_n f_n(x)$。固定 $x\\in(0,1]$，取 $n=\\lceil\\frac{1}{x^2}\\rceil$，則 $\\frac{1}{x^2}\\le n\\le\\frac{1}{x^2}+1$，所以 $nx^2\\le1+x^2\\le2$。",
